{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120000426446-1120_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261120015147\"/><p>巨鼠無懼在商場內游走。</p><p>全港鼠蹤處處有！有網民昨日（19日）在社交平台發貼文，標題寫上「利群商場6:30見到」，相中見一隻巨鼠無懼在商場內游走。</p><p>網民留言問貼主在那個位置，貼主回覆，「地下、電梯位置」，另有人指，「唉，癡(黐)線，香港仔越嚟越污糟」、「我係米奇，唔係老鼠」、「日光日白，幻覺」。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T18:01:44.598583+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:04:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T00:57:37.729712+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T17:55:13.785468+00:00","content_hash":"058aa5bc77167ddb8d0c28c3a144ccfa6b6ee982c8a0b2ec0ea564eea11b19ac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}